# 4 — Operation & Observation

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  Installed[Installed State] --> Observe[Observe]
  Observe --> Integrity[Integrity Check]
  Integrity --> Change{Changed?}
  Change -->|No| Evidence[Evidence Record]
  Change -->|Yes| Quarantine[Preserve / Quarantine]
  Quarantine --> Restore[Verified Restoration]
  Restore --> Recheck[Re-hash]
  Recheck --> Evidence
```

Record service state, selected runtime configuration, periodic integrity observations, detected changes, repair actions, restoration source, replacement hash, and rollback evidence.

Monitoring is bounded and resource-aware. A repair must preserve the previous state before replacement and must verify the replacement against a trusted reference.
